# =============================================================================
#  SECTION G — USER: ACCESS CONTROL
# =============================================================================

### ─── 30. CHECK ACCESS — free content (expect: hasAccess: true, reason: free)
GET {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/access
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 31. CHECK ACCESS — premium content without subscription
### (expect: hasAccess: false, reason: no_access)
### Replace contentId with the UUID of a premium/tier-gated item
GET {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/access
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 32. GET MY ACCESS RECORD (progress, bookmarks, last accessed) ─────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/my-access
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 33. GET MY FULL LIBRARY ───────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/library/me/library
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


