# =============================================================================
#  SECTION I — USER: BOOKMARKS
# =============================================================================

### ─── 38. ADD BOOKMARK — page 47 of an ebook ───────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/bookmarks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "position": 47,
  "note": "Important formula for quadratic equations — memorise this."
}

### ─── 39. ADD BOOKMARK — video timestamp 1320 seconds (22:00) ───────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/bookmarks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "position": 1320,
  "note": "Dr. Adebayo explains the AP general formula here — great example."
}

### ─── 40. ADD BOOKMARK — no note ───────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/bookmarks
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "position": 120
}

### ─── 41. REMOVE BOOKMARK at position 47 ────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/bookmarks/47
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─── 42. REMOVE BOOKMARK at position 1320 ─────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/library/{{contentId}}/bookmarks/1320
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
